<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In PhysWorld: From Real Videos to World Models of Deformable Objects via Physics-Aware Demonstration Synthesis" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Additional Results</span></a></li>
